
# 8Byte DevOps Assignment


# Terraform infrastructure is organized into
# separate files for better maintainability.

# provider.tf          - AWS provider
# variables.tf         - Input variables
# vpc.tf               - VPC and Internet Gateway
# subnet.tf            - Public and private subnets
# security_groups.tf   - Security groups
# iam.tf               - IAM roles and policies
# ecr.tf               - ECR repository
# ec2.tf               - Application EC2 instance
# alb.tf               - Application Load Balancer
# rds.tf               - PostgreSQL RDS
# outputs.tf           - Terraform outputs

# No resources are defined in this file.
